WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.869
-♪ (OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING) ♪
-(WIND WHISTLING)

00:00:02.969 --> 00:00:03.737
ROGER PARSLOW:<i> Lyra!</i>

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:06.038
<i> Lyra, can you hear me?</i>

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:08.508
-Roger!
-ROGER:<i> You have to help me.</i>

00:00:08.608 --> 00:00:10.243
Where are you?!

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:11.677
(WHISPERS) Roger.

00:00:11.777 --> 00:00:13.345
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪

00:00:13.445 --> 00:00:16.082
LORD ASRIEL:<i> I am gathering
 the greatest from every world.</i>

00:00:17.182 --> 00:00:18.752
<i> Even the heavens above.</i>

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:21.621
SPEAKER:<i> The real war is coming.</i>

00:00:22.688 --> 00:00:24.290
LORD ASRIEL:
<i> And I would risk everything</i>

00:00:24.757 --> 00:00:26.126
<i> to ensure victory.</i>

00:00:27.893 --> 00:00:29.696
What are you willing to risk?

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:32.932
FATHER GOMEZ:
<i> Father President,</i>

00:00:33.032 --> 00:00:34.667
<i> the time is coming.</i>

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:37.404
<i> The child is with her mother.</i>

00:00:38.338 --> 00:00:39.539
CARDINAL MACPHAIL:
<i> Bring them to me.</i>

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:41.408
<i> Dead or alive.</i>

00:00:42.808 --> 00:00:44.144
It will be an honor.

00:00:45.344 --> 00:00:47.380
♪ (MUSIC INTENSIFIES) ♪

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.381
WILL PARRY:<i> The last thing
 my dad asked me to do</i>

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:50.850
<i> was take the knife to Asriel.</i>

00:00:51.517 --> 00:00:53.319
LYRA SILVERTONGUE:
<i> First, we need to go
 to the land of the dead.</i>

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:54.420
ROGER:<i> Lyra!</i>

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:55.321
LYRA:<i> Roger!</i>

00:00:55.821 --> 00:00:57.590
WILL:<i> You can't bring people
 back from the dead.</i>

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:58.825
LYRA:<i> We have to try.</i>

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:02.461
WILL:
<i>And what if we don't come back?</i>

00:01:02.561 --> 00:01:04.864
Then we will have died
doing something important.

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:07.534
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪

00:01:07.634 --> 00:01:10.770
Asriel,
our daughter is in danger.

00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:12.838
<i> The Magisterium want her dead.</i>

00:01:13.272 --> 00:01:14.874
<i>Do you know who they say she is?</i>

00:01:15.641 --> 00:01:17.543
SERAFINA PEKKALA:
<i> If the prophecy is true,</i>

00:01:18.344 --> 00:01:21.614
<i> she will achieve something
 far beyond your rebellion.</i>

00:01:21.714 --> 00:01:24.217
♪ (MUSIC INTENSIFIES) ♪

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:25.585
Do not fail her.

00:01:26.885 --> 00:01:29.254
♪ (MUSIC INTENSIFIES) ♪

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:30.890
MARY MALONE:<i> Something changed.</i>

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:32.858
<i> Everything was in balance,</i>

00:01:32.958 --> 00:01:35.195
<i> but now the world is dying.</i>

00:01:36.696 --> 00:01:38.832
MRS. COULTER:
<i> Our lives are entwined.</i>

00:01:40.867 --> 00:01:42.034
<i> It hurts when we're apart.</i>

00:01:42.134 --> 00:01:44.237
(SCREAMS)

00:01:45.071 --> 00:01:46.473
MARY:<i> The greatest love...</i>

00:01:49.775 --> 00:01:51.744
<i> is the one
 that you can't live without.</i>

00:01:54.347 --> 00:01:56.216
The one that
you're prepared to die for.

00:01:58.384 --> 00:01:59.719
We're in this together.

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:01.787
<i> No turning back.</i>

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:03.656
LORD ASRIEL:<i> The Authority...</i>

00:02:04.157 --> 00:02:05.258
<i> wants you to be afraid.</i>

00:02:05.592 --> 00:02:07.894
Well, the Authority
has no power over us.

00:02:07.994 --> 00:02:11.163
Today, we... are free!

00:02:11.263 --> 00:02:12.264
(CROWD CHEERING)

00:02:12.364 --> 00:02:14.767
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:18.538
-(IOREK BYRNISON ROARS)
-SERAFINA:<i> Hope...</i>

00:02:19.005 --> 00:02:20.240
<i> will spark...</i>

00:02:22.141 --> 00:02:23.242
<i> in darkness.</i>

00:02:23.342 --> 00:02:26.679 line:0%
♪ (MUSIC INTENSIFIES) ♪

